      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastport%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Eastport remains an unincorporated community within Torch Lake Township, meaning it has no municipal government of its own.",
